<section class="section faq" id="support">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Answers before checkout</h2>
    <p>Clear answers on delivery, returns, and bundles — everything you need to know before checkout.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-grid">
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details open><summary>When does free UK delivery apply?</summary><p>Orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery; below that, standard delivery is £4.99. Final shipping costs are always confirmed in the cart and at checkout.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do bundle discounts apply automatically?</summary><p>Yes — when your cart qualifies for a bundle or automatic discount, it is applied for you at checkout. No codes to hunt for.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I buy without creating an account?</summary><p>Yes. You can check out as a guest and complete your order without creating a store account.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I choose the wrong item?</summary><p>No problem — contact support and we will help you find the right size or routine, or arrange a simple exchange or return.</p></details>
    </div>
    <aside class="support-card" aria-label="Support prompt">
      <span>Need help choosing?</span>
      <strong>Tell us your pet, routine, and problem to solve.</strong>
      <p>We can point you toward cleaning, walking, feeding, or daily-care products before you buy.</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:contact@activepaw.co.uk">Ask support</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "FAQ accordion", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ accordion" }] }
{% endschema %}
